---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import CtaStrip from '../components/CtaStrip.astro';
import { SITE } from '../consts';
import { breadcrumbSchema, localBusinessSchema } from '../lib/schema';

const schema = [
  localBusinessSchema(),
  breadcrumbSchema([
    { name: 'Home', url: SITE.url },
    { name: 'About', url: `${SITE.url}/about` },
  ]),
];
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About Kian Locks"
  description="Kian Locks Ltd is a North & Central London locksmith fitting Avocet ABS 3-star high-security cylinders only. Independent, insured, accountable."
  schema={schema}
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <Breadcrumbs items={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'About' }]} />
      <h1>Built for one job. Done well.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Kian Locks Ltd is a London locksmith with a deliberately narrow
        offering: the lock change. Done with one cylinder, fitted by
        one team, to a single uncompromising standard.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <article class="prose">
        <h2>What we do</h2>
        <p>
          We replace the euro-profile cylinder on residential and small
          commercial doors across North &amp; Central London with the
          Avocet ABS 3-star Kitemarked cylinder. That is the entire
          service.
        </p>
        <p>
          We don&rsquo;t fit smart locks unless they accept ABS. We
          don&rsquo;t open safes. We don&rsquo;t cut keys for vehicles. We
          do one thing, and we&rsquo;ve made it our business to do it
          better than the locksmith who tries to do twenty.
        </p>

        <h2>Why this approach</h2>
        <p>
          The lock-change market in London is broken in a specific way.
          Most callouts arrive unquoted, fit a 1-star cylinder, charge
          for &lsquo;labour by the hour&rsquo;, and leave. Six months
          later the cylinder snaps under attack — because it was always
          going to.
        </p>
        <p>
          The fix is not better marketing. It&rsquo;s a different product,
          a different process, and a different kind of conversation. We
          quote in advance, we fit the only cylinder that meets the
          standard alone, and we tell you exactly what you&rsquo;ve
          received in writing.
        </p>

        <h2>Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          Kian Locks Ltd is registered in England and Wales. Our work is
          covered by full public liability insurance. We have been
          fitting locks across London since 2020.
        </p>

        <h2>What we promise</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>The price quoted is the price paid. No hourly add-ons.</li>
          <li>The cylinder fitted is Avocet ABS 3-star Kitemarked. We do not fit anything else.</li>
          <li>Same-day across our service area. Pre-booked weekend slots available.</li>
          <li>Written documentation of every fitting — for your records and your insurer.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaStrip />
</BaseLayout>
